PROJECT: ShareHub Nepal - NEPSE stock market website

FRAMEWORK: Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript strict mode

STYLING: Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + Framer Motion

DATABASE: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Realtime + Storage)

CHARTS: TradingView Lightweight Charts v4

STATE: Zustand (client) + TanStack Query v5 (server)

AI: Python FastAPI on Railway

PAYMENTS: eSewa v2 + Khalti v2

NEPAL CONTEXT:

- Currency: NPR (Rs) - never USD in UI
- NEPSE hours: Sun-Thu 11 AM-3 PM NPT
- Support Nepali (ne) and English (en)
- Font: Google Fonts Outfit (headings) + JetBrains Mono (data)

SECURITY:

- All API routes validate JWT tokens
- Rate limiting on auth endpoints
- CSRF protection on state-changing requests
- Content Security Policy headers
- Never expose Supabase service role key client-side

CODE STYLE:

- Server Components by default, "use client" only when needed
- No any types
- Every async function has try/catch + error boundary
- Every page has loading.tsx and error.tsx
- Validate inputs with Zod before any API call

FILE STRUCTURE:

- src/app/ - pages (file-based routing)
- src/components/ - reusable React components
- src/components/ui/ - shadcn components
- src/lib/ - Supabase client, utils
- src/services/ - API service functions
- src/stores/ - state stores
- src/hooks/ - custom hooks
- src/types/ - TypeScript types
